<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry reinstated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry reinstated as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it reinstated coverage of DeVry Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- CS First Boston was a manager of DeVry's recent offering of 1.8 million shares of common stock at $21 a share.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
